<title>USA: S&amp;T Bancorp Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>S&amp;T Bancorp Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANA, Pa. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			  5,954		    5,263</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.10		    $1.82</p>
<p> Net			 23,249		   20,469</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at December 31, 1996 were about $1.5 billion versus $1.4 billion at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses at December 31, 1996 was $4.3 million versus $3.8 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>1996 fiscal year results include a third quarter charge of $883,000 to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
